    "detailed_description": "Rush to deliver to every mailbox before you get fired in this cute and goofy pixelart platformer with 50+ levels to flop through.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs a fish out of water you have 2 controls: flop left and flop right. You can hold down to perform a bigger flop, and various obstacles on your way will provide you with new ways to traverse each level.<br />\r\nSlippery Delivery aims to make use of these simple controls as diversely as possible, and explore many mechanics while keeping the gameplay fresh and exciting.",
